compiler proves.

@topic concept.mutable-map
title: MutableMap[K, V]: an insertion-ordered mutable map
summary: std::mutable_map::MutableMap[K, V] maps Hashable keys to values and iterates in insertion order: a replaced value keeps its key's place, a removed and re-set key goes last.
